; Every operator that can appear in one program, at once.
;
; Five calls: the dream, the gate's condition, one per branch of the square, and
; the mediation. The subject is bound, so both branches read the same one — that
; is the whole reason the count is five and not seven.
; expect: calls 5
; expect: clean
; expect: answers
((# std/shape)
 (+ "Answer in as few words as possible."
    (= subject (! "Answer with exactly: the retry queue")
       (% "Answer with exactly the single character: 1"
          (["Reply with both readings, separated by ' | ', nothing else."]
            (-> subject "Name one failure mode of this.")
            (^ (-> "Name one strength of this." subject)))
          "Answer with exactly the word: unreachable"))))
